<title>UK: KEPCO sets $200 mln 30-year bond, seven-year put.</title>
<headline>KEPCO sets $200 mln 30-year bond, seven-year put.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Lehman Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KOREA ELECTRIC POWER CO</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.75	MATURITY   *01.AUG.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.672    PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    99.672    SPREAD     *+77 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *PRICED TO PUT AT PAR AFTER SEVEN YEARS.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
